| desc = {{H|Sand King}} appears at the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted location.<br><br>The ability hits the secondary target, then the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
}}

 * Has the following targeting functionalities:
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*** When unit-targeted, Sand King chases the unit-targeted enemy until it is within the {{M|cast range}} and casts Burrowstrike toward its direction.
*** Does not home and can be evaded by enemy units.
** {{Symbol|Target|Point}} or {{Symbol|Target|Ground}}
*** Casts the ability on the point-targeted location.
*** The ability functions as a {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted ability with {{M|Alt-Cast}} enabled.
*** {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Teleport}}
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|MinDistance < [[Abilities#Target Point|Point]]Distance < MaxDistance}}
***** When point-targeted beyond the min or max distance, Burrowstrike [[teleport]]s Sand King toward the min or max distance respectively.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**# Does not {{M|disjoint}} incoming {{M|projectiles}} upon cast.
**# Does not break {{A|Sand King|Sand Storm}}'s {{M|invisibility}} upon cast, if the ability ends within the Sand Storm radius, but not other invisibility sources.
**# The {{#var:Burrowstrike basic2}}-second {{M|cast backswing}} has the following properties:
**#* Sand King {{M|cannot act}} during this time.
**#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|CastBackswing {{=}} BurrowDuration + TeleportDuration}}
**# {{Symbol|Projectile|Spike}}
**#* Once the cast backswing completes, Sand King {{M|teleports}} to and {{M|Facing Angle|text=faces}} the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location once the spine [[projectile]] reaches it.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**# Applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|sandking_impale}} to all affected enemy units:
**#* [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-8-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-8-2.png|84px]]
**#** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{calc|v1+{{#var:Burrowstrike value1}}|v1={{#var:Burrowstrike cast range}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1+{{#var:Burrowstrike value1}}|v1={{#var:Burrowstrike cast range tal}}}}|15tal}})-distance away with the [[cast range]] and spine radius.
**#* [[File:Dota2 Sand King Burrowstrike 1-3.png|21px]]
**#** Applies a 350-distance offensive {{M|upward movement}} over the first 0.52 seconds of the debuff duration.
**#*** Not affected by {{M|status resistance}} sources.
**# {{M|Stun}}
**# {{Symbol|Projectile|Spike}}
**#* The spines travel at {{#var:Burrowstrike basic1}}-speed, reaching max distance in {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{calc|v1/{{#var:Burrowstrike basic1}} round2|v1={{#var:Burrowstrike cast range}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1/{{#var:Burrowstrike basic1}} round2|v1={{#var:Burrowstrike cast range tal}}}}|15tal}}) seconds.
**#* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**#** The spike that hit enemy units is visually larger and elevated. This also visually applies on the following units:
**#*** {{M|Fogged units}}, and additionally release some dust particles.
**#*** {{M|Invisible}} units.
**#*** {{M|Untargetable}} units.
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} upon landing.
**#* When interrupted, Burrowstrike prematurely applies the landing effects at the affected enemy unit's current location.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Burrowstrike icon0}}
| desc = Sand King burrows into the ground and tunnels forward, damaging and stunning enemy units above him as he resurfaces. Adds Caustic Finale poison to heroes hit<br><br>Can be put on alt-cast to immediately cast in the desired direction, without walking towards the targeted location.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Directly use {{A|Sand King|Caustic Finale}}'s ability values.
** Applies a {{#expr:{{G|tick rate}} round3}}-second {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|sandking_caustic_finale_orb}} if the caster does not have the ability upon Burrowstrike cast.

